  "Posted 'Y4 Docking Bay' dested Yavin 4: Docking Bay (Dark); 'DS2 Docking Bay' Death Star II: Docking Bay; 'MONCAL' the Dark Mon Calamari system; 'Spaceport Docking Bay' the Dark Special Edition site; 'Vader W/Stick' Darth Vader With Lightsaber; 'Victory Class SD' Victory-Class Star Destroyer; 'Judiactor' Judicator; 'Flag X' Flagship Executor; 'Ominous Rumours' Ominous Rumors; the weapon posted on two lines as \"Darth Vader's / Lightsaber\" dested Vader's Lightsaber.",
